sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Researcher
  participant C as Controller
  participant B as Budget and ledger
  participant W as Supervisor
  participant X as Sandbox
  participant E as Evaluator
  U->>C: Approve protocol hash
  C->>B: Reserve and queue atomically
  C->>W: Lease attempt and policy
  W->>X: Execute approved candidate
  X-->>W: Declared outputs only
  W->>E: Validated artifacts
  E-->>C: Trusted metrics and verdict
  C->>B: Commit outcome and settle budget
  C-->>U: Evidence report or next approved action
